<title>MALAYSIA: KL tin closes down 12 cents at 14.45 rgt.</title>
<headline>KL tin closes down 12 cents at 14.45 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tin price in Malaysia closed 12 cents lower at 14.45 ringgit ($5.72) a kg on initial high offering despite a higher London close, traders said.</p>
<p>The market saw an opening offer of 120 tonnes against bid of 54 tonnes. Final turnover was 96 tonnes against 75 on Monday with buying mainly from Malaysia, Europe and Japan.</p>
<p>The local price differential to London was at $90 a tonne premium against $160 previously.</p>
<p>--Tan Lee Lee (603-230-8911) ($1=2.5270 ringgit)</p>
